This is 121 problem on LeetCode.
The original classical Best Time to But and Sell Stock

Problem:
We need to return the max profit such that we need to buy a stock in one day and sell it in the other day

Such that we may end up the max profit !!

Approach:

Step1: Indetifying the minimum stock to buy
Step2: Check if there a high price after we bought the stock.
Step3: Return the Max Profit
